					</environmentVariables>
					<skipTests>${skipTests}</skipTests>
					<!--
						The JVMCI/Graal flags that used to live here were dead: they referenced ${compiler.dir},
						a property no pom in this repo defines, so the fork was launched with the literal
						string "${compiler.dir}" as its module path and upgrade module path. The upgrade never
						took effect, and EnableJVMCI enabled the interface against no compiler. Removed
						2026-08-07 rather than left misleading. To restore: define a compiler.dir property
						pointing at a Graal compiler.jar / compiler-management.jar pair (none is installed
						under C:\Projects\tools as of 2026-08-07), then recover the exact flag text from this
						file's git history at commit a3fb2edc. The flags cannot be quoted here verbatim
						because XML comments may not contain a double hyphen.
					-->
					<argLine>-Xmx4096m</argLine>

